    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25597" root="ضحك" body-key="D">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضُحْكَةٌ</span></b>  A thing, (Lth, TA,) or a man, (S, O.
TA,) <i>that is laughed at,</i> or <i>ridiculed;</i> i. e. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يُضْحَكُ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِنْهُ</span>: (S, O, K, TA:) an epithet importing more
discommendation than <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضُحَكَةٌ</span>. (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See also
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَضْحَكٌ</span>.

